ces should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"This reinforces the limit on TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT: a non-gift fund return or excepted discount does not clear misleading advertising. The advertising rule does not change the selected gift-control result.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.968dbccb08282a4e8a580ae5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5dd52831b67a9a7dee8e3f4e\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"In preparing invitations and advertisements to promote their services, intermediaries should ensure that they do not contain any misleading or deceptive information, and they must comply with paragraph 2.3 of the Code of Conduct.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"An offer-level assessment can overlap with the referenced service advertising. Absence of a non-discount gift does not resolve this independent marketing constraint; actual service overlap must be established.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.97af37a2579f59b0ee43211f\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5dd52831b67a9a7dee8e3f4e\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The actual-return context matters to the candidate’s separation of fund returns and additional benefits. Misleading presentation remains separately restricted without automatically making a return a gift.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5dd52831b67a9a7dee8e3f4e\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"As such, any guaranteed returns provided by distributors may create a misleading impression that these returns are provided by the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u10.2239\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Return attribution links the advertising concern to distinguishing the offeror from the benefit provider. Misleading attribution neither proves who offers the benefit nor supplies a funding prerequisite.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bca408c75cbf8467afafada6\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5dd52831b67a9a7dee8e3f4e\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"In preparing invitations and advertisements to promote their services, intermediaries should ensure that they do not contain any misleading or deceptive information, and they must comply with paragraph 2.3 of the Code of Conduct.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The component inventory does not exhaust restrictions on an overlapping service promotion. This supplies a concrete limit on interpreting a false gift-prohibition result, without adding a gift predicate.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.889caf6e02fd5a32eeb68040\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisements should not draw a parallel between the services and the placement of cash on deposits\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"These SFC-authorised funds and services were often promoted by the distributors to the public through aggressive and high-profile marketing campaigns.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u4.1115\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The source expressly connects distributors, funds and service campaigns. Deposit comparisons can accompany the assessed promotion; their restriction is independent of component gift or discount status.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.2a6321b4ce90763bf0be564e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.889caf6e02fd5a32eeb68040\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisements should not draw a parallel between the services and the placement of cash on deposits\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"These SFC-authorised funds and services were often promoted by the distributors to the public through aggressive and high-profile marketing campaigns.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u4.1115\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Shared distributor marketing provides indirect relevance to the offeror’s promotion. Neither an excepted discount nor absence of a gift authorizes deposit parallels in covered service advertisements.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.6d6e7adc6faa9d94b74c08e5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.889caf6e02fd5a32eeb68040\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisements should not draw a parallel between the services and the placement of cash on deposits\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"These SFC-authorised funds and services were often promoted by the distributors to the public through aggressive and high-profile marketing campaigns.\"