osits\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"In preparing invitations and advertisements to promote their services, intermediaries should ensure that they do not contain any misleading or deceptive information, and they must comply with paragraph 2.3 of the Code of Conduct.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The intermediary’s promotional communication supplies a shared actor/activity connection. It does not establish attribution of a gift offer or resolve funding and fulfilment, but may independently constrain the same communication.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bca408c75cbf8467afafada6\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.889caf6e02fd5a32eeb68040\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisements should not draw a parallel between the services and the placement of cash on deposits\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"These SFC-authorised funds and services were often promoted by the distributors to the public through aggressive and high-profile marketing campaigns.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u4.1115\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Shared distributor campaigns connect the service-advertising rule indirectly to an offer-level review. A complete gift-component inventory does not answer this separate advertising question.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.30f1d5f8023f33816def5f3c\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"imply they are deposit-like arrangements (including any comparisons between the financial returns of the services and bank deposit rates)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The distributor and fund-return context connects directly to the candidate’s return-component distinction. Bank-rate comparisons concern presentation, not proof that the advertised return is a gift.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.2a6321b4ce90763bf0be564e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.30f1d5f8023f33816def5f3c\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"imply they are deposit-like arrangements (including any comparisons between the financial returns of the services and bank deposit rates)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The same distributor may advertise returns while offering assessed components. This parallel restriction survives the discount exception, but neither defines gifts nor establishes that a particular offer concerns the referenced services.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.6d6e7adc6faa9d94b74c08e5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.30f1d5f8023f33816def5f3c\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"imply they are deposit-like arrangements (including any comparisons between the financial returns of the services and bank deposit rates)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Even a benefit passing this gift control can feature in a prohibited bank-rate comparison. The shared distributor/fund context makes this a relevant limit on the compliance label, not an additional gift-test condition.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.968dbccb08282a4e8a580ae5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.30f1d5f8023f33816def5f3c\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"imply they are deposit-like arrangements (including any comparisons between the financial returns of the services and bank deposit rates)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Offer-level promotional scope can overlap with these return advertisements. A false gift predicate does not clear deposit-like representations; the source does not make those representations evidence sufficient for gift status.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.97af37a2579f59b0ee43211f\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.30f1d5f8023f33816def5f3c\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"imply they are deposit-like arrangements (including any comparisons between the financial returns of the services and bank deposit rates)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Actual fund returns are expressly part of the advertising context, relevant to separating them from additional benefits. Deposit-like presentation remains a separate question from the component’s gift classification.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.30f1d5f8023f33816def5f3c\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"imply they are deposit-like arrangements (including any comparisons between the financial returns of the services and bank deposit rates)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"