.u20.5257 and db43e253bea18.u21.5903. Their indirect relevance is supported, while applicability to a particular combined offer remains fact-dependent.\",\"Misleading guaranteed-return or deposit-like language does not itself establish an actual guarantee, a distributor top-up, gift status, or the attribution of a benefit offer. The advertising controls supply no component-allocation rule or modification of the fee/charge discount exception.\",\"The candidates already disclaim overall compliance. These claims provide concrete parallel advertising restrictions supporting that boundary; they do not require adding advertising compliance to the paragraph 3.11 gift predicate.\"]}"}}
